  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1</em></p><p><em>████ and Light — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level, you have finally learned to expand your domain. At initiative 20, all creatures in your domain take 6d12 radiant damage. While within your domain, your movement speed doubles and all movement on your turn is considered an instantaneous teleport and cannot be reacted to as your every move is at light speed, causing your body to break down into light particles whenever you move. As an action on your turn, you can teleport anywhere within your domain. You can choose one creature within 5 ft of the point you start from or end up at. That creature takes 4d12 radiant damage.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
